---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageBanner from "../../components/PageBanner.astro";
import { getContent } from "../../lib/content";

const content = getContent("en");
const page = content.pages.privacidad;
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={page.title}
  description={page.description}
>
  <PageBanner
    eyebrow={page.eyebrow}
    title={page.h1}
    intro="At Deftcode, we respect your privacy by design. We do not use third-party tracking cookies or invasive fingerprinting."
    dark
  />

  <section class="relative bg-black text-white py-20 px-4 md:px-12 rule-page-bottom">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12 font-sans">

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">1. WHAT DATA WE COLLECT</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">Only what you enter in the contact form: your name, company (optional), email, phone number, the type of service you are interested in and, if you like, the details you want to share.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">We do not collect sensitive data, financial information, or anything beyond that form.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">2. WHAT WE USE IT FOR</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">Exclusively to answer your inquiry and arrange a 20-minute call. Nothing else.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">We do not use it for advertising, we do not subscribe you to any mailing list, and we do not build profiles about you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">3. WHO WE SHARE IT WITH</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">We do not sell, rent, or hand over your data to third parties.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">The form is submitted through Web3Forms, the provider that receives the message and forwards it to our inbox (<a href="mailto:contacto@deftcode.dev" class="text-[#FF4D00] underline">contacto@deftcode.dev</a>). It is the only third party involved, and it acts solely as a technical intermediary so the message arrives. Its infrastructure may be located outside Argentina.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">4. HOW LONG WE KEEP IT</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">For as long as it takes to handle your inquiry and, if we end up working together, for the duration of the business relationship.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">If you ask us to delete it, we delete it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">5. WHAT YOU CAN ASK US</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">You can ask for access, correction, or deletion of your data by writing to <a href="mailto:contacto@deftcode.dev" class="text-[#FF4D00] underline">contacto@deftcode.dev</a>. We reply within 24 business hours.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">In Argentina, the processing of personal data is governed by Law 25.326, and the enforcement authority is the Agencia de Acceso a la Información Pública (AAIP).</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">6. COOKIES AND ANALYTICS</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">This site does not use tracking cookies or advertising.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">We measure overall site usage with Cloudflare Web Analytics: first-party, cookie-free analytics with aggregated data such as visits, page views, source, and device. It does not identify you personally, does not follow your browsing across other websites, and is never cross-referenced with form data.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">If we ever change how we measure, we announce it on this page first.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">7. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY</h2>
        <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">If we change anything on this page, we update the date on this page.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-2 border-white/20 p-8 bg-white/[0.02]">
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-[#FF4D00] uppercase tracking-tight mb-4">8. SERVER LOGS</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">Like any website, the server hosting this page keeps technical access logs (IP address, date, and visited page) so the site works and to prevent abuse.</p>
          <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">Those logs are never cross-referenced with your contact data or used to profile you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-white/20 pt-8 flex items-center justify-between font-mono-meta text-xs text-white/60">
        <span>LAST UPDATED: NOVEMBER 2026</span>
        <span>{content.siteMeta.location}</span>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
